	(text "This section measures the current going through the string:\n- Nearly identical to the main 'sense' block for measuring the voltage across the string but optimized for reading the anticipated actuation current across our 0.1Ω Current sense resistor\n- Notice there is not logic for assessing signal polarity - since we are sensing current from voltage spike we applied, it is fair to assume we already know the polarity of the current"
